    "failure_limit": "Neither observer199 nor3000 records the exact rejected parent callback input or unique guard predicate atnative100. The leak is proven independently; causal completion from leak/camera movement to this exact cancellation remains unproved. Do not label it contact/invulnerability failure, prove a Nose exchange, or convert86/1 into success."
