    "reuse": "Reuse all unchanged L5/shared transport/producer/acceptance evidence. No repeated producer, all-level suite, full-route/all-kill/all-kit, device/export or original level acceptance gate. A targeted regression may close this separate defect; it need not establish Back difficulty novelty."
